From b7a742e70fcf7d57ef24c73a961a58fa7909e218 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: a <a@a>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 07:24:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] local: changer fault injection (MOVE MEDIUM sense, door, UNIT
 ATTENTION 28h/00h) for simulation

---
